   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Diversif n&#xe4;ringsliv Olene</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ind diversif Olenegorsk</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att st&#xf6;dja en utveckling mot diversifiering av n&#xe4;ringslivet i Olenegorsk; modernt ledarskap och statlig institu- tionsutveckling i relation till n&#xe4;ringslivet &#xe4;r centrala fr&#xe5;gor i denna kunsakaps&#xf6;verf&#xf6;ring. Genomf&#xf6;rade organisation &#xe4;r Swedgroup och samarbetspart &#xe4;r administrationen i Olenogorsk.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at diversifying the economy of the city of Olenegors Through a training of trainers program, knowledge will be transferred to Russian Consultants on how open project management is performed in modern Western firms. Development of the public institution related to local labour markets will be performed in similar mode.</narrative>
  </description>
